                "none": [
                    "I was hidden.\n\nFor years I have been living in secret, in a safe haven called Eridian for wolves and others alike inside The Deadlands.\n\nHiding from the Highers� laws and the eyes of the Elites, the Highers� weapon, I make sure we survive the best we can while we live our simple life.\n\nWhen we collect a female in need to bring her back to Eridian, it was supposed to go as planned, like any other time.\n\nAnd it did, until a letter changed it all.\n\nAs Alpha of Eridian, I have to keep our home a secret and my pack safe at any cost.\n\nEven if the cost is myself.\n\nWith beasts plaguing Vrohkaria, the threat of Eridian being discovered and being brought to the Highers for the crimes we have committed�\n\nWe may all fall, and there's no one to catch us.\nEspecially not the Alpha of the Elites, who may be my downfall and the greatest danger to my heart.\n\n\nAuthor's note- This is the first book in The Hidden of Vrohkaria series and does end in a cliffhanger. This is a first person, MF, spicy, enemies to lovers dark fantasy romance and only suitable for ages 18+ and above. This series contains elements that may be unsettling. It contains mature language, explicit/graphic scenes, and darker elements that progress as the series continues. Please see inside for the content this book contains.\nRead less"
